-checklist\"><li>Strukturu webu a interní odkazy</li><li>Titulky a meta popisky</li><li>Nadpisy a obsah stránek</li><li>Alt texty obrázků</li><li>Sitemapu a indexaci</li><li>Strukturovaná data</li><li>Google Firemní profil</li><li>Měření v Search Console</li></ul>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "93c6f21", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Probrat můj web", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "6adbb05", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "prehled"}, "elements": [{"id": "fd35677", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d40f644", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f5d03f8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "32ccad2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Postup", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "bdc92e2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "SEO optimalizace webu v 8 krocích", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "67a0417", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Jak postupujeme, aby váš web získal návštěvnost z vyhledávání.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "b23b8f1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-grid4", "ht